  "description": "DL-Val91 (the same 91 dev contexts / 19 families as dev91-audit-v1) under the H257 two-fold split. Stored scores of the H257 phase-2 tournament (2026-11-04): TabFM, TabFM ensemble, Kumo-Tabular L/S, TabPFN 3.5 (n_est 8 and 1), TabICL v2, TabDPT 1.3, Mitra v2 and 4 frozen LLM regressors. Not comparable with dev91-audit-v1 (different row split).",
  "split": "jope.s1-two-fold/v1 (H257): per context the same row count and family as dev91-audit-v1, split in half (fold 0 / fold 1); fit on one fold, predict the other, both directions. ratio_k = RMSE_k / RMSE of the training-fold mean; logratio = mean of the two log ratios; sd_logratio = half their absolute difference; gate = exp(logratio) <= 0.90 and both folds beat the baseline; u = s1_utility_zero_comp = -(0.9 * logratio + 0.2 * sd_logratio) if the gate passes, else -2.0 (also -2.0 on a fit failure). Definition: evaluate_tabular_foundation_dl_val91.py docstring, origin/main 571873a38c.",
